flowchart TB
  subgraph control [Controlled from the phone]
    create[Create or change]
    status[Ask status]
    pause[Pause or cancel]
  end
  runtime[Agent runtime and scheduler]
  loop[Always-on agent]
  flow[Workflow]
  create --> runtime
  status --> runtime
  pause --> runtime
  runtime --> loop
  runtime --> flow
  loop --> out[Delivery when there is a result]
  flow --> out
